  "title": "Can't the ScrollWheel set components of different heights?",
  "content": "<p>I want to make the CustomScrollTimeTextCenter fully visible, without being cut off by anything else, and without leaving any extra gaps.<br />But it's this kind of effect, I've tried adjusting all sorts of parameters, and I still can't get the effect I want.<br />I want this kind of effect：</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/0fe85761-8b07-4e79-983d-6475dfc16bdd.png\" /></figure><p><br />Here's an introduction to the problem：<br />I have two custom components of different heights<br />CustomScrollTimeTextCenter 70<br />CustomScrollTimeText 44</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/5c7c03f9-5316-4f29-bce5-b5b01d0b54ba.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
